Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

A REVISION reads 200904310000Z, the 31st of April. Its own trailing
comment says Dec 04, 2009, and the clause sits between the revisions of
October 29, 2009 and May 20, 2013, which is where December 2009 belongs
and April 2009 does not. The repair is the date the comment gives.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/JUNIPER-COS-MIB
+++ b/JUNIPER-COS-MIB
@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@
     	DESCRIPTION
         "Modified the max range for JnxCosFcIdentifier from 7 to 15."
 
-        REVISION     "200904310000Z"    -- Dec 04, 2009
+        REVISION     "200912040000Z"    -- Dec 04, 2009
         DESCRIPTION  "Added Rate Limit stats"
 
         REVISION     "200910290000Z"    -- Oct 29, 2009
